4
00:00:13.032 --> 00:00:16.587
Today we learn: How I Feel. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.888 --> 00:00:21.122
Happy. Say it with me. Happy!

6
00:00:24.617 --> 00:00:28.217
Sad. Say it with me. Sad!

7
00:00:31.727 --> 00:00:35.127
Angry. Say it with me. Angry!

8
