11
00:01:01.108 --> 00:01:04.408
Calm. Say it with me. Calm!

12
00:01:07.909 --> 00:01:11.609
Excited. Say it with me. Excited!

13
00:01:15.104 --> 00:01:18.604
Worried. Say it with me. Worried!

14
00:01:22.104 --> 00:01:25.720
Bored. Say it with me. Bored!

15
00:01:29.229 --> 00:01:32.729
Shy. Say it with me. Shy!

16
00:01:36.224 --> 00:01:40.008
