17
00:01:43.505 --> 00:01:51.864
Grammar time! I feel, . Listen. I feel happy. I feel tired now.

18
00:01:51.914 --> 00:01:57.728
Your turn. Say it with me. I feel happy. I feel tired now.

19
00:02:03.013 --> 00:02:09.689
I feel happy when I play. I feel tired at night. Sometimes I feel scared in the dark.

20
00:02:09.739 --> 00:02:11.204
I like this story!

21
00:02:11.894 --> 00:02:16.997
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:17.047 --> 00:02:18.197
Angry!

23
00:02:19.099 --> 00:02:24.227
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:25.393
Calm!

25
00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:33.437
Think and answer. How do you feel today?

26
00:02:33.487 --> 00:02:34.703
Great answer!

27
00:02:35.713 --> 00:02:38.043
This unit's value is Empathy.

28
00:02:38.093 --> 00:02:39.810
I can show empathy every day!

29
00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:45.021
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

